{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/202676m7JuFkYK1795082826.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>莎莎國際盈利急升2.3倍。</p><p></p><p>截至9月底半年賺1.7億元，主要受惠核心市場，港澳銷售表現顯著提升，線上銷售及盈利快速增長。中期息增至每股4仙。期內收入升三成至近26億元。</p><p></p><p>港澳市場全面增長，同店銷售升近三成九，旅客銷售佔比由去年五成一升至六成三，連帶營業額、交易宗數，及每宗交易平均金額均有增長。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T10:52:22.966666+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T09:51:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T10:37:14.379068+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T10:45:44.096591+00:00","content_hash":"20ab8bd29337571a942dbd6e470e116441d8d164883dbdaae93d235aa9604675","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T10:52:22.966666+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}